1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,653
Speaking, task three. Story number 12: The ambulance. What happened to Grandma yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:10,367 --> 00:00:12,106
What happened to Grandma yesterday?

3
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,600
Yesterday morning Grandma was at home cooking lunch.

4
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,399
The kitchen floor was wet and Grandma fell.

5
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,733
Her leg hurt and she couldn't get up.

6
00:00:40,933 --> 00:00:42,500
Luckily her grandson was at home.

7
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:47,367
He immediately called 155 and said what had happened and where they live.

8
00:00:47,567 --> 00:00:49,420
The ambulance arrived ten minutes later.

9
00:00:49,633 --> 00:00:52,100
The paramedics took Grandma to hospital.

10
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:55,300
At the hospital the doctor examined her and did an X-ray.

11
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,021
Her leg wasn't broken, only bruised.

12
00:00:58,233 --> 00:01:00,230
In the evening Grandma could go home.

13
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:08,555
Tell story 12 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
